Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 18:08:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Apply TouchWizHome compatibility fixes

Port the targeted smali changes found in the patched TouchWizHome sample
without replacing the full APK. This enables launcher/finder feature gates and
guards fragile role, input, transition, handoff, and edge-panel calls that can
fail on the target port.
